	(text "OUTPUT: 4 x 22 uF 16 V ceramic on the converter side of the sense resistor (the loop is compensated\nfor 10 uF minimum effective capacitance), plus 2 x 22 uF after it. ISP/ISN are Kelvin\nconnections to the two ends of R_SNS: route them as a pair, separate from the power copper."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 371.348 60.198 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "311fe75a-eea2-4b52-a5f0-1e2ee3db3af8")
	)
	(text "INPUT: 4 x 10 uF 50 V ceramic (about 20 uF effective after DC-bias derating, TI recommends at least\n4.7 uF effective), 100 nF close to the VIN pin. Optional 100 uF bulk (DNP) for long supply leads.\nPlace the ceramics right at the buck-side FET drain and PGND (shortest loop)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 38.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "56b990d4-5df7-4299-976a-0b621aa2d21f")
	)
	(text "CONTROL NETWORK (all AGND returns go to the AGND island, which joins GND only at the net tie\nnext to the VCC capacitor, as in TI's layout example)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 50.8 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "5b611f3c-870c-4b7a-ac68-58950c754d23")
	)
	(text "POWER STAGE: keep V_INPUT -> Q1 -> Q2 -> GND -> input caps loop tiny; SW1/SW2 traces short and wide,\ntop layer, no vias. Inductor: 4.7 uH, saturation current 12 A or more, DCR 12 mohm or less\n(Coilcraft XAL1010-472 or equivalent). 0.1 uF bootstrap caps right at BOOT/SW pins."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 114.3 160 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "86e3a028-75c7-4cfc-a849-ab5ed6c338fa")
	)
